  "created": "2026-09-26T01:26:29.227Z",
  "description": "A CQRS framework for .NET 8/9/10 that is wired at compile time. A Roslyn source generator emits the command, query, stream and notification dispatch and the handler registrations as plain C#, so there is no runtime reflection and the whole thing is trimming- and Native-AOT-safe; analyzers catch wiring mistakes as you type. Pipeline behaviors (validation and exception handling on by default; logging, retries, timeouts, rate limiting, idempotency and unit of work opt-in) and a transactional outbox come behind one fluent builder. Install this meta-package for the full setup: the contracts, the runtime, the pipeline behaviors, the source generator and the analyzers.",
