  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 5.0.0, a major release with breaking changes. Application code uses the CQRSharp and CQRSharp.Pipelines namespaces (global usings with ImplicitUsings); store and unit-of-work implementations add CQRSharp.Persistence.\n            Handler interfaces take no context type argument, AddCqrsGenerated is configured through its builder and registers validation and exception handling in both forms (opt out with UseValidation(false) / UseExceptionHandling(false)), and startup validation runs only when you call ValidateOnStart().\n            Rebuild every assembly that runs the source generator, and drain the outbox with 4.x processors before upgrading.\n            See https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp/blob/v5.0.0/CHANGELOG.md for the full notes and the upgrade steps from 4.2.1.",
